arker reason required (AC4), undecidable site reported not failed (AC6)' — no explicit non-firing/negative case for asyncio.run or a harnessed cwd/env site.","AC2 exercises the FP surface only in aggregate via --collect-only exiting 0."],"finding":"The guard's own test suite (AC1/AC3/AC4/AC6) enumerates positive-violation and edge cases but does not explicitly name a NEGATIVE-CASE predicate test proving the AST detector does NOT fire on the patterns the plan calls out as the reason AST beats regex — e.g. an asyncio.run site, or a properly-harnessed cwd=<fixture path> / env=subprocess_env(...) site. AC2 (full tier collects clean) covers false positives only in aggregate; a targeted false-positive unit case would pin the aliasing/callee-resolution logic directly.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"fdb7c49d46ff08dc6","impact":0.55,"is_primary":null,"location":"Testing section / AC1 / AC6","norm_id":"n641e19de39a49088","priority":0.3438,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":[],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"Seed the guard fixture with an asyncio.run call and a harnessed subprocess.run(cwd=fixture_path, env=subprocess_env(...)) and assert the predicate returns zero violations for both.","tier":"LLM","validity":0.625,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"no","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"underspecified_certification","internal_conflict":"none","